WEBVTT

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.870
Da da da da da da da...

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:15.870
Ta-da!

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:19.040
Oh! Isn't that the earnings report?

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.660
Even after paying the Agency,
there's still this much kirakuri left over!

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.830
Ooh!

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:31.700
President! We'll be able to summon
the goddess sooner than we thought!

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.620
We can thank Mineko for collecting so much!

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:42.250
Once again, thanks for joining our company!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.330
The office look suits you!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:50.500
In any case, we can see the light
at the end of the tunnel!

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:53.660
We're just a few steps away from our goal now!

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:58.500
Yeah! We've gotta keep the
ball rolling and get more kirakuri!

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.330
So without further ado...!

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Let's go out and clear another dungeon!

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.910
Yeah!

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:08.080
Eh?

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.080
Huh?

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:17.700
<i>Let's dive right into today's letters</i>

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:23.200
<i>It's "Personal Advice" and the title is</i>

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.200
<i>"Hurry into Love! Hurry Love! Love!!"</i>

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:39.790
<i>Hey, hear me out.</i>
<i>There's something I really wanna say</i>

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:45.000
<i>You've got courage to follow</i>
<i>your dreams which is why I chose you</i>

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.120
<i>Is it a risky bet</i>

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:52.580
<i>Despite no experience,</i>
<i>we jumped right in together</i>

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:56.080
<i>And this unpredictable story</i>

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:02.160
<i>Is your creation--</i>
<i>a heart-throbbing innovation</i>

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.620
<i>Quickly! Quickly! Take me along</i>

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.250
<i>On a bittersweet love venture</i>

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:12.040
<i>Ah! Measured not by skill</i>
<i>but by scale and romance</i>

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:17.080
<i>Hurry! Hurry! Boldly, subtly, show your appeal</i>

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:22.120
<i>Ah! Our meeting was a miracle</i>
<i>that can't be neglected</i>

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:25.700
<i>It's galactic level</i>

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.200
<i>I see. Sounds like you're head over heels.</i>

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.500
<i>Let's tell him, just like battle</i>

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.910
<i>"Hurry into Love! Hurry Love! Love!!"</i>

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:39.290
<i>Everyone, Hurry! Hurry Love! Love!!</i>

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:44.000
"Episode Ten: Corporate Warrior"

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.120
G-Guys, what's up?

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.000
Is something wrong?

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:54.120
No, not at all. But I have something
else to do, so I can't come.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.870
Me too! I'm going with Akari!

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:59.750
I see... How about Makoto?

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.830
Uh, I can't today.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:05.910
We collecting plants. And finding herbs.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.000
Y-You're getting along...

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.580
I have some business to do
at the Adventure Agency.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.290
I'm sorry, but I can't come.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:20.870
Hmm, this seems like classic bad timing.
Oh, well. We'll go another day.

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:25.700
Oh? And why's that? Can't you go with Yutoria?

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.160
Yeah, that's right!

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:29.620
You'll be just fine with Yutoria.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:34.410
B-But in the end, Yutoria's just a secretary.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.790
If any maju show up, we might be in trouble.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:44.870
Oh, please. Didn't you fight in battles
back when the old man was here?

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.620
Huh? Is that true?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.410
Y-Yeah...

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.200
Yutoria was pretty amazing!

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:55.330
She used to wipe out maju one after another!

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:59.580
Destroyer Yutoria!

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:01.830
Grim Reaper Yutoria!

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.540
...is what we called her!

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.910
D-Don't bring that up!

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:10.750
Yutoria's war stories?
I think I wanna hear more!

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.040
Excuse me?

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:14.620
Huh?! U-Uh...

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:19.120
It's true that I'm able to fight.

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:23.000
But if I join the battles,
we won't have a secretary.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.410
And if that happens,
his battle orders will be pure garbage!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.040
Th-That's a hurtful way of putting it.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.370
I don't believe that at all!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.830
Our president's pretty reliable.

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:41.660
Mineko doesn't know.
But if Makoto says, it's true.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:46.870
It's not as if he's totally useless.
He usually does what I ask.

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.660
Thanks, guys. More or less...

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:51.700
Well then, it's settled!

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:56.040
Yutoria and the president
will explore a dungeon together!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.290
I-I don't know, though...

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:01.950
It's okay, Yutoria! Have a bit of faith in me!

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:08.500
All right. If that's what our
president wants, I'll try fighting!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.290
I've been itching for battle!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:20.250
Y-Yutoria? That's the one sword
that curses you financially.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:22.700
Huh? Whoa!

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.410
Y-You okay?

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:26.830
Watch out for credit card fraud.

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:29.540
You better not co-sign anything.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:34.870
I-It's okay! It's not like I was cut by it,
so I shouldn't be cursed.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.910
I think... Probably...

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:45.000
Th-That's a normal sword, right?

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:50.830
Don't worry about it!
Anyways, this is the gate we're gonna explore today!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.200
This is a dungeon I've done before,

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:57.870
but it's pretty easy for how
much kirakuri we can gather.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.540
It's perfect for today!

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:00.910
O-Okay...

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:02.080
Come on, Minato!

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:05.950
Hold on! Before that... Did you just say...?

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:10.500
Oh, you noticed? I'm only all business
when I'm the secretary.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.660
Now that I'm fighting,
I'm back to your childhood friend!

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.290
I think I like this Yutoria better.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:26.500
You can eat my share.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.080
Thanks.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:30.500
I'd say that went well!

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:34.500
Yutoria would never fight
unless we talk her into it.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:38.750
It's good for her to get exercise
once in a while!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.580
Now the two of them might get closer!

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:45.790
He should be grateful!
He'll get friend-zoned without us!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:49.160
F-Friend-zoned? Who taught you that word?

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:52.750
For real! He's nothing like a certain someone!

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:55.370
Don't eat too fast or you'll choke.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:56.700
Thanks.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:09.410
Amazing, Yutoria!
Who knew you could fight like that?!

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:12.080
You don't even need orders from me!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:14.290
Th-That's not true!

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:19.080
It was just a slaby.
But I'm kinda rusty from never fighting.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:23.700
You call that rusty? You put the average
soldier and knight to shame!

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:26.160
No wonder everyone called you Grim Reaper--

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:27.200
What?

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:31.950
A-Anyways! I'm just glad to have you with me!

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:36.410
And to think how you used to cry
from the neighborhood brats!

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:39.200
Now look at how much I rely on you.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:42.330
I-I rely on you too, you know.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:47.040
I'm lucky to have a childhood
friend like you, Minat...

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:49.120
Hmm?

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.080
More?! Sheesh!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:57.540
Wait, Yutoria! Something's off.
This one has legs.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:02.200
Is that a legged slaby?
It's exactly how I imagined it!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:05.660
Maybe it's different, but a slaby's still a slaby!

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:07.290
Here I come!

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:24.290
Huh? What? The more I cut it...!

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:28.910
Yutoria, stop attacking everything
in sight! It just multiplies!

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:30.950
Th-Then what should I do?!

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:40.750
Yutoria, hit its weak spot!
If you do that, it won't multiply!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.200
Weak spot?! And where's that?!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:46.410
Um, it's gotta have one somewhere!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:49.330
It's not much help if you don't know!

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.370
Minato, do something!

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:59.580
A-At this rate, I better find it quick!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:01.620
Um, um...!

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.250
That's it, Yutoria!

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.910
Wh-What's it?!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.160
That! The necktie!

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:12.450
That, huh?!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:22.870
Yeah! Let's see you try to multiply now!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.870
Say your last prayers!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:33.160
Destroy!

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:36.200
Whoa... One after another...

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.040
You ran outta luck when you met me!

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.160
You're not getting away!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.370
C'mon! C'mon! Let me destroy you!

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.870
Destroying complete!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:10:00.200
D-Destroyer Yutoria...
I better stay on her good side.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:07.200
Whew! That sure took it outta me!

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:10.080
Yeah... Maybe don't push yourself so hard.

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:17.580
Ahh, so refreshing!

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:21.290
This reminds me of when
I asked you to be president.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:26.450
I-I guess so.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:30.370
I never imagined we'd
be doing dungeons together.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:34.250
What's more, with you as president
and me an employee.

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.410
Yeah.

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:40.830
When we pretended to be adventurers
as kids, the roles were switched.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:44.830
I was president and you were the employee.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.750
Yeah. But in your company,

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:52.410
the way you worked me without
any pay was more like a sweatshop.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:57.250
Did I? Even so, I remember how much fun it was.

00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:59.160
That's true.

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:02.540
Wow, I got all nostalgic on you.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:06.200
It's fun to remember the past,
but let's go find that kirakuri.

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:12.830
Yutoria, maju!

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:15.250
Huh? That maju...

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.370
Yutoria, look out!

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.120
Whazzup!

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.450
Huh? What's going on?

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:35.000
U-Um, that's the boss of the dungeon
the last time I came through.

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:36.950
That's me!

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:40.120
He's friendly to me for some odd reason.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:43.120
Miss! You look beautiful today!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.120
Here!

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:47.250
I-I don't want those.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.120
Sad...

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:53.120
S-Say, do you know where we can find kirakuri?

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:55.250
Lemme see...

00:11:56.120 --> 00:11:57.120
I know!

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:59.120
Over here!

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:05.160
It's that way! Now we'll get kirakuri,
and it's all thanks to you!

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.200
I don't know about that...

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:12.160
No, it's true!
That's the Destroyer Reaper for you!

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.040
You mixed up my nicknames.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.790
S-Sorry!

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.160
We got more than expected!

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:26.200
Yeah. It took us well into the night though.

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:30.290
It was nice to get active
for a change. I enjoyed it.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:33.040
Let's do it again sometime, Minato.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.120
You've got it.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.540
Now then, it's back to being
a secretary, President!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:42.370
Oh. You switched back already.

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:46.000
Come on, let's put this kirakuri in the books!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:03.750
Hmm. We're gonna need a lot more
kirakuri to summon the goddess.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:07.540
I'm sorry to make you stay late and help.

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:11.200
It's only natural.
We found the kirakuri together.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.950
Oh! Should we put it in storage once we're done?

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:19.540
Y-Yeah... Once we're done, please...

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.870
Y-Yutoria? Y-You look kinda...

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:27.040
...seductive.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.330
It feels hot in here. I'm sweating so much.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:35.700
R-Really? I thought it was kinda cool.

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:39.700
You think so? Hmm... But it's so hot!

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:42.540
My body is burning up!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:44.790
Y-Yutoria?

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:47.700
Minato, I...

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:54.500
I can't... help myself... anymore...!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:56.450
Wha--?

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.540
Y-Yutoria?!

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.660
You okay?! Yutoria? Yutoria!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:12.330
Not good! What to do?!

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.120
S-Should I start CPR?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.080
And then, cardiac massage...?

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.790
No, no, no! Take her to the hospital!

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:21.620
Huh?

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:25.700
I-I'm fine. I just have a little fever.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:26.950
Yutoria?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:29.790
If I just rest, I'll be...

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:51.040
Wh-Where am I?

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:53.000
Oh. You're awake?

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:57.700
Um, President? I...

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.910
You don't remember? You fainted, Yutoria.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:02.040
What?

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:05.250
Could be from not fighting in a while.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:09.200
It doesn't seem that serious,
but you've got a high fever.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:11.870
Sorry.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:16.450
Don't be. I'm the one who's sorry
for pushing you too hard.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:18.120
I gotta get back to work.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:22.160
N-No, you need sleep!
If you don't, it'll get worse!

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:26.250
Right now, your job is to get rest and recover.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.250
I see...

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:34.410
Well, I'll go wrap up the paperwork,
so yell if you need me.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.250
U-Um, President?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:37.950
Hmm? What is it?

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.750
Um, well...

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:47.120
Oh, yeah. You haven't had dinner yet, huh?

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.750
Want me to whip something up for you?

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:51.620
But, I'd feel bad.

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:58.080
Don't. You need to take food breaks
or I'll feel like a terrible boss.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:01.370
Go on. Say whatever you want.

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:05.580
I-In that case, if you actually mean that,

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:09.620
I think I'd like some of Minato's
homemade egg soup.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.080
Perfect!

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.660
Go on, help yourself.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:35.120
Thank you.

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:40.330
It's delicious!

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:44.910
Good to know.
Oh, and don't force yourself to eat it all.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.620
Hmm? What's up?

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:52.080
Nothing. Just thinking it's nice
to be sick once in a while.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:53.410
Huh? Why?

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:56.450
Because you're being extra kind to me.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:01.160
Wh-What are you saying? Are you delirious?

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.700
Possibly! I might just be!

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:08.580
Which is why you need to take good care of me.

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.450
G-Got it.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:23.120
It's fine if you head home, President.
It's already so late.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.950
No, I'll spend the night in the office too.

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:32.040
Huh? Y-You don't have to go that far!
And I'm using the bed, so...

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.250
Don't worry, I'll crash somewhere!

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:37.700
Adventurers like us can fall asleep anywhere!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.700
But...

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.330
U-Um...!

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:45.410
If you want, you can have half the bed.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:46.580
Eh?

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:51.370
I-I'm fine with it!
I won't allow you to sleep on the floor!

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:55.080
W-Well, I was gonna sleep on the sofa, but...

00:17:56.290 --> 00:18:00.080
A-Anyways, you need to sleep on a proper bed!

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:01.580
I don't know...

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:05.870
I'm not saying it as your secretary,
but as your childhood friend. Got it?

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:07.660
A-All right.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:08.660
Good!

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.540
This brings back memories.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:19.790
Huh?

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:23.790
When we were little, we often
slept side by side, didn't we?

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.080
We sure did.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.910
You talked in your sleep.

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.910
And wet your bed too.

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:32.620
I-I was really little back then.

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:36.870
You're the one who was too afraid
to go to the bathroom alone.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:39.620
Th-That may have happened too.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:48.250
We haven't changed at all.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:52.000
True, except we're president and secretary now.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:55.200
At the crux of it,
we're the same childhood friends.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.200
Yeah.

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:59.080
Hey, Minato?

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.700
Hmm? What?

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:04.660
If we collect enough kirakuri,
summon the goddess,

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:08.000
and find the old man, what then?

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.120
What then? Well...

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:16.750
If nothing else,
I'm hoping to bring my dad back.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:21.290
And after that?
Do you think you'll quit being president?

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:22.370
That's...

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:27.160
At first, I thought I would.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:32.080
That if we found my dad,
I'd let him take over as president.

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:35.870
But now, I think I want to keep doing it.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.750
Minato...

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.040
I've fallen in love.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.750
Huh?

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:47.000
With Kibou Company, our warm workplace,
and all her employees.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.250
Thank you.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.040
So even if my dad comes back,
I'm staying president.

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.950
I'll just have him be chairman or something.

00:19:55.950 --> 00:19:58.250
Yeah, that's a good idea.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:02.500
Because I wanna be your secretary
for a while longer too.

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.540
Yutoria...

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:08.120
It's a pleasure to work with you, President.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:10.450
Yeah. Right back at you.

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:22.950
Oh, right. I slept at the office last night.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.790
What's that nice smell?

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:29.620
Oh, good morning, President!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.620
I was just about to wake you!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.040
Yutoria? Should you even be up?

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:40.410
Yeah, I feel much better now!
It's all thanks to you caring for me!

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:44.330
I didn't do much.
But I'm glad to see you're better.

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:48.120
As thanks for all you did,
I've got something for you.

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.120
Hmm?

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:55.080
It looks tasty! This is really all for me?

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.620
Yeah! Please help yourself!

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:59.000
Don't mind if I do!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.250
It's good!

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:08.500
Thank you! Eat as much as you like!

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.950
Okay! Gosh, it's so good!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:16.620
Like I thought, it's Yutoria
who I'm most at ease with.

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.500
Good morning!

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.200
--Huh?
--Morning!
--Morning!

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:22.000
G-Good morning.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:24.080
Morning!

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:25.910
Morning, everyone.

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:28.870
It's rare for you guys to arrive together.

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:31.120
We all ended up on the same ferry.

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:33.660
What's this? An office breakfast?

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:34.870
Looks tasty.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:40.120
H-Hands off! This is something
Yutoria made for me!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:45.040
Yutoria did?
How nice to get a homemade breakfast!

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:47.120
Oh? Is that how it is?

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:52.040
D-Don't misunderstand!
He was just taking care of me, so...

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:53.080
Huh?

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:58.660
Wh-What the--?

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:43.250
<i>Looking way up into the night sky</i>

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:47.870
<i>A pretty jewel caught my eye</i>

00:22:47.870 --> 00:22:52.200
<i>Clear skies tomorrow sure would be nice</i>

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>Now, make a wish upon a star</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:58.410
<i>Lazily</i>

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:01.250
<i>Today comes to a close</i>

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:05.620
<i>Dead tired and worn out</i>

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:12.120
<i>Good work</i>
<i>Let's do our best again tomorrow</i>

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:14.700
<i>Goodnight</i>

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:16.870
<i>Every day is sparkling</i>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:21.410
<i>Just like a box of jewels (sparkling)</i>

00:23:21.410 --> 00:23:23.620
<i>And so brilliant</i>

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:25.830
<i>Any work undone</i>

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:30.410
<i>We'll leave for dreamland (sleep tight)</i>

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:33.910
<i>Let's embark on adventure</i>

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>So sleep soundly tonight</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:43.450
<i>And meet up with me in our dreams</i>

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:46.540
<i>Sleep tight</i>
